            {
             "t": "h1",
             "html": "Gathering knowledge and experiences from over <strong>18 countries</strong> across <strong>6 continents</strong>"
            },
            {
             "t": "p",
             "html": "To ensure diverse perspectives and minimize bias, we gathered insights from stakeholders with experiences spanning over 18 countries across 6 continents. Our research included input from a wide range of voices, including representatives from cultural organizations, study abroad professors, international students, and global ambassadors."
            }
