           "t": "html",
           "items": [
            {
             "t": "h3",
             "html": "Competitive Analysis"
            },
            {
             "t": "h1",
             "html": "Current resources are <strong>text-heavy</strong>, <strong>lack focus</strong>, and <strong>miss unwritten rules</strong>"
            },
            {
             "t": "p",
             "html": "Everyone we spoke to relied on multiple resources to prepare for their travels, often spending significant time jumping between websites and books to gather the necessary information. When we examined these resources, we found them to be overwhelmingly text-heavy, scattered in focus, and rarely addressing unwritten rules—except for one obscure Swiss hotel site that none of our stakeholders had never come across. Additionally, many of these resources were not mobile-friendly, making on-the-go access difficult."
            }
           ]
          },
